अगर आपको लगता है कि time सबके लिए same होता है…
तो भाई, आपने exam कभी दिया ही नहीं!
Hello dosto!
Main hoon Albert Einstein…
aur aaj main aapko ek bada secret batane wala hoon —
mummy jhooth nahi bolti,
bas time relative hota hai!
Socho exam hall ka scene…
ghadi bolti hai,
“Beta, main Olympic runner hoon!”
1 ghanta पलक झपकते ही उड़ जाता है।
Heart beat तेज, question लंबा,
aur time? गायब!
अब वही ghadi,
jab aap apni crush ke saath baithe ho…
तो बोलती है,
“Arre nahi nahi,
aaj main retirement le rahi hoon…”
5 minute भी पूरा 1 ghanta लगने लगता है।
Same ghadi…
same time…
par feeling alag!
Isi ko kehte hain Theory of Relativity!
Ab socho,
aap bus pakadne ke liye full speed me bhag rahe ho…
aur time kehta hai,
“Arre bhai, main break pe hoon!”
Jitni zyada speed,
utna zyada time ka drama!
Einstein kehta hai,
agar aap light ki speed se travel karo…
to birthday aana hi band ho jaayega!
Na cake,
na candles,
diet automatic ON!
Science wali language me bolein to —
time aur space fix nahi hote।
Aur desi language me —
situation ke hisaab se
time apna rang badalta hai।
Isiliye jab mummy kehti hain,
“Bas 5 minute me aa rahi hoon…”
to samajh jao dosto,
wo Einstein certified 5 minute hote hain!
Science samjho,
time ka maza lo,
aur exam se pehle padhai zaroor kar lo…
kyunki wahan relativity kaam nahi aati! 😄
